   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all, <div><br></div><div>I see that this was marked as closed:</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/issues/1239\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/issues/1239&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462607770000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IYxVznfAL0FsNDTmcdVqh\">https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/issues/1239</a></div><div>but with verbose=F in rstan::optimizing I&#39;m still getting output (I&#39;m on 2.9.0). Is there some other argument I need to specify as well? </div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div><div><br></div><div>David. </div><div><div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\">David A. Knowles,<br>Stanford University.<br>E-mail: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">know...@gmail.com</a><br>Web: <a href=\"http://cs.stanford.edu/~davidknowles/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cs.stanford.edu/~davidknowles/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462607770000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1abtTNcjJoDB91GTlphXnX\">http://cs.stanford.edu/~davidknowles/</a></div>\r\n</div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "MFPBY--_AgAJ",
   "from": "Ben Goodrich",
   "author": "743bbacc59f4b25f",
   "date": "2016-02-03T22:09:51Z",
   "subject": "Re: Suppressing output from rstan::optimizing",
   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">On Wednesday, February 3, 2016 at 4:34:57 PM UTC-5, David Knowles wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I see that this was marked as closed:<div><a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/issues/1239\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/issues/1239&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462607774000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2JpibGHRTH7OSSTi_XsVlT\">https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/issues/1239</a></div><div>but with verbose=F in rstan::optimizing I&#39;m still getting output (I&#39;m on 2.9.0). Is there some other argument I need to specify as well? </div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>@Daniel, was there something more we were supposed to do on the R side for that issue? Setting verbose = FALSE suppresses the iteration progress, but still prints the settings information at the top<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">STAN OPTIMIZATION COMMAND </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">LBFGS</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>init </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> random<br>save_iterations </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>init_alpha </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.001</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>tol_obj </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1e-12</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>tol_grad </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1e-08</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>tol_param </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1e-08</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>tol_rel_obj </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>tol_rel_grad </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1e+07</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>history_size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>seed </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1106089312</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>initial log joint probability </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.65295</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Optimization</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> terminated normally</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Convergence</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> detected</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> gradient norm </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> below tolerance</span></div></code></div><br>Ben<br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
